From cc2468e4abb51aef4cb6b95093095a2ab1f21414 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 01:24:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Expose AITER dynamic INT8 MoE in vLLM

- Add explicit AITER INT8 backend selection.
- Route gfx90a and gfx1201 through Quant2 CK.
- Route gfx1100 through AITER Triton MoE.
- Convert weights and scales per architecture.
- Preserve Triton as the automatic default.

Tools used:
- GPT: 5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
---
